tnasch has seen many deaths and repairs."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7190"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e133443890d4862669387266a361a9d1df0e67c33385f987329a5a8d7df6382e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a20f63d1b1ad22cfb546588df4417a7f7993c57962c3f49518181194d8bc552.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田村 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s104","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s104","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s104","name":"田村 ゆかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1886","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c7191","characterName":"ペトルーシュカ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c7191"},"originalCharacterName":"ペトルーシュカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the five gynoids containing Ruili's soul data. Petrushka belongs to Ng Wing Shing - a memento of the rape and murder of Kong Ruili one year prior. Ng's dress-up doll and assistant."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Petrushka is a heavily modified combat gynoid, devised by Ng as a defensive measure against Kong Taoluo. Her limbs contain scythe-like blades and high-caliber machine guns."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7191"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/19129984a32dc4f534157102753b72851c19cd630c75f891533894dd762c8a85.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0dc04e9a5def609e801d798e4cbbb271265823901437654ca4b720a6a4f0b0e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"