\" belongs to Liu Haojun - a memento of the rape and murder of Kong Ruili one year prior."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Designed to look and sound like Ruili; Haojun is obsessive and overly protective of his gynoid. Haojun treats her like a princess."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7193"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b6d420e938958bbde7718fbf57dd8e319797c8bd98fe49818e1f03117929c260.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/6840c52f9beaddb394b5ba74e50f5a18ec1decaa2640431127692c59767c3656.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田村 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s104","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s104","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s104","name":"田村 ゆかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1889","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c7194","characterName":"元 尚英","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c7194"},"originalCharacterName":"元 尚英","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"But no matter your reasons... there can be no excuse for abandoning your loyalty to the Society.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Conjoined twins, fated from birth to become half-machine. Just and honourable, the Yuen brothers are renowned in the Qingyun Society as the \"Twin Yuen Heroes.\" A Waijia master, Sheung Ying wields guai sticks."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7194"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c6cb6aba0c9a3c487514f32b5f14931540f299f230a13a2d9bba2ebb20c5651.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.dat